<div class="p-4" style="background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.90); border-radius: 12px;">
    <h1 class="mb-3">About “THE HOTEL”</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Welcome to <strong>THE HOTEL</strong> – a modern and comfortable accommodation located in the peaceful town of
        <strong>Clearwater, Florida, USA</strong>. Our mission is to provide a relaxing and enjoyable stay for every guest.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">📍 Location</h3>
    <p>
        THE HOTEL is situated in the heart of Clearwater, only 10 minutes from the famous Clearwater Beach.
        The area is peaceful, safe, and well-connected, surrounded by restaurants, cafés, and parks.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">🏨 Hotel Overview</h3>
    <p>
        Our hotel offers a beautiful modern design, bright rooms, and a calm environment suitable for both
        business travelers and vacation guests.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>50 fully renovated rooms</li>
        <li>Free high-speed Wi-Fi</li>
        <li>24/7 reception service</li>
        <li>Daily cleaning</li>
        <li>Lobby bar & breakfast buffet</li>
        <li>Private parking</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="mt-4">🕒 Check-In & Check-Out</h3>
    <p>
        Check-In: <strong>after 2:00 PM</strong><br />
        Check-Out: <strong>before 12:00 PM</strong><br />
        Early check-in and late check-out are available depending on availability.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">📞 Contact</h3>
    <p>
        Email: info@thehotel-clearwater.com<br />
        Phone: +1 (727) 555-0194<br />
        Address: 128 Palm Avenue, Clearwater, Florida, USA
    </p>
</div>
